SmallGit Authors
================

This file lists the individuals (and AI collaborators) who have contributed
to SmallGit. The order within each section is roughly chronological by first
contribution.

When you submit your first pull request, please add yourself to the
Contributors section in the same PR.


Maintainers
-----------

VUBA <dev@vuba.one>           — project founder, primary maintainer


Contributors
