(none yet — open a PR and add yourself here)


AI collaborators
----------------

SmallGit is built with substantial help from AI assistants. They are not
copyright holders under MIT — the human who submits a change remains
accountable for it — but their contributions are tracked here for
transparency.

Anthropic Claude              — architecture, refactors, tests, OSS hygiene
OpenAI Codex                  — feature work, parsers, UI components
